<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 27.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 27.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Dec 27	Dec 24	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  247.030     247.500     237.040    4.21 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  306.520     306.350     303.640    0.95 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.910     159.200     165.490   -3.98 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.174	47.192	48.410   -2.55 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  416.360     415.500     366.280   13.67 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.775     141.965     147.886   -4.13 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.185	16.220	14.975    8.08 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  215.100     216.630     230.135   -6.53 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.889	 1.894	 1.939   -2.58 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.577	 1.580	 1.575    0.13 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  183.600     184.755     206.030  -10.89 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
